# Linked abilities are linked only within one text (CR 607.1, 607.2a, 607.5): Keen-Eyed Curator exiles Bot2's Ornithopter
# from its graveyard with its own "{1}: Exile target card from a graveyard". Two turns later Mirrorweave makes the Curator
# a copy of Emperor of Bones until end of turn (CR 707.2), and Bot1 adapts it: the +1/+1 counters trigger the copied
# "put a creature card exiled with this creature onto the battlefield", which refers only to cards Emperor of Bones's own
# exile ability exiled. The Ornithopter was exiled by the Curator's text, so it is not among them and stays in exile.

